<!--
單篇全文頁（genomics-prototype，2026-09-01 整頁改寫）。定位是「EDM 的
延伸頁」：讀者從信件點「閱讀全文」進來，看到的要跟信件同一套版型
（640 寬白卡、藍刊頭、同字體同色），讀完就走，不把人帶進網站的領域
首頁。所以刻意沒有：回首頁連結、語言切換、意見回饋、領域導覽。
歷史期數與領域瀏覽的入口只在信尾，不在這頁。
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ topic.chosen_headline }}｜{{ newsletter_name }}</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; padding: 24px 12px; background-color: #eef1f4;
         font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", "PingFang TC", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .card { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d8dee4; }

  .head { background-color: #1f4e8c; padding: 28px 32px; }
  .head .eyebrow { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #bcd0e8; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .head .brand { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; margin: 0; }
  .head .meta { font-size: 13px; color: #bcd0e8; margin: 8px 0 0; }

  .body { padding: 24px 32px 8px; }
  .back { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; color: #5a6672; text-decoration: underline; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .chips { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .chip { display: inline-block; background: #eef3fa; border: 1px solid #c5d4e8; padding: 2px 8px;
          font-size: 11px; color: #1f4e8c; margin-right: 6px; }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.5; color: #173a66; margin: 0; }
  .subhead { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1f4e8c; margin: 6px 0 0; }

  .stats { margin: 18px 0 0; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f6f7f9; border: 1px solid #e6ebf0; }
  .stat { display: inline-block; margin-right: 24px; }
  .stat b { font-size: 18px; color: #173a66; }
  .stat span { font-size: 12px; color: #5a6672; margin-left: 6px; }

  .section-heading { font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1c2b38; margin: 22px 0 0; }
  p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; color: #3a4652; margin: 12px 0 0; }

  .insight { margin: 22px 0 0; padding: 14px 18px; background: #f2f6fb; border-left: 3px solid #1f4e8c; }
  .insight .heading { font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; color: #1f4e8c; margin: 0; }
  .insight p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }

  .sources { margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 14px 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e6ebf0; }
  .sources a { font-size: 13px; color: #5a6672; text-decoration: underline; display: block; margin-top: 6px; }
  .sources .label { font-size: 12px; color: #9aa5b0; }

  .foot { background: #f6f7f9; border-top: 1px solid #d8dee4; padding: 16px 32px;
          font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: #5a6672; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="eyebrow">DELTA · NBDMD</p>
    <p class="brand">{{ newsletter_name }}</p>
    <p class="meta">第 {{ issue_no }} 期</p>
  </div>

  <div class="body">
    <a class="back" href="/issues/{{ issue_id }}">← 回本期摘要</a>
    <div class="chips">
      {% if topic.primary_tag %}<span class="chip">{{ topic.primary_tag }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <h1>{{ topic.chosen_headline }}</h1>
    {% if topic.chosen_subhead %}<p class="subhead">{{ topic.chosen_subhead }}</p>{% endif %}

    {% if topic.stats %}
    <div class="stats">
      {% for stat in topic.stats %}<span class="stat"><b>{{ stat.value }}</b><span>{{ stat.label }}</span></span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% for section in topic.sections %}
    {% if section.heading %}<div class="section-heading">{{ section.heading }}</div>{% endif %}
    {% for para in section.paragraphs %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}

    {% if topic.delta_insight %}
    <div class="insight">
      {% if topic.delta_insight.heading %}<p class="heading">{{ topic.delta_insight.heading }}</p>{% endif %}
      {% for para in topic.delta_insight.paragraphs %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="sources">
      <span class="label">原文出處</span>
      {% for src in topic.sources %}
      <a href="{{ src.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ src.source_name }}｜{{ src.title }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">
    本報由自動化系統產出，每則均附原文出處。僅供台達內部參考，請勿外流。
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
